# Chris Boerner Portfolio Website - Project Context

## Project Overview

This is a personal portfolio website for Chris Boerner, a computer engineer specializing in embedded systems, digital design, and electronics. The site is hosted on GitHub Pages with a custom domain (boernerc20.me).

**Live Site**: https://boernerc20.me
**Repository**: git@github.com:boernerc20/boernerc20.github.io.git
**Branch**: main
**Deployment**: Automatic via GitHub Pages (no build process)

## Technology Stack

- **Pure Static Site**: No frameworks, no build tools, no package.json
- **HTML5**: Semantic markup with accessibility features (aria labels)
- **CSS3**: Vanilla CSS with Custom Properties for theming (1,742 lines)
- **JavaScript**: ES6+ vanilla JavaScript, no libraries (849 lines)
- **External Services**:
  - Google Fonts (Inter, JetBrains Mono)
  - Google Charts API (for travel map visualization)
  - Google Model Viewer (for 3D PCB rendering)
- **Hosting**: GitHub Pages with CNAME configuration

