## Code Style Guidelines

**HTML**:
- Use semantic elements (`<header>`, `<section>`, `<article>`)
- Include aria labels for accessibility
- Keep consistent indentation (2 spaces)

**CSS**:
- Use CSS Custom Properties for theming
- Follow BEM naming convention for classes
- Mobile-first media queries
- Group related styles together

**JavaScript**:
- Use ES6+ features (const/let, arrow functions, template literals)
- Comment complex logic
- Keep functions small and focused
- Use meaningful variable names

## Troubleshooting

**Changes not appearing on live site**:
- Wait 1-2 minutes after pushing
- Clear browser cache (Ctrl+Shift+R)
- Check GitHub Pages settings in repository

**Theme toggle not working**:
- Check localStorage in browser console
- Verify data-theme attribute on <html> element
- Check js/main.js for theme toggle logic

**Images not loading**:
- Verify file paths are correct (case-sensitive on Linux/GitHub)
- Check image file sizes (optimize if >500KB)
- Ensure images are committed to repository

